/T (quick start users manual type information)
/TU (quick start users manual type information)
/Type /Annot
/V (IMPLEMENTED REQUIREMENTS\012M10\055FR\05501\072 Record attendance and correct the same daily mark \055 \0431\056\012M10\055FR\05502\072 Read and filter attendance history \055 \0432\056\012M10\055FR\05503\072 Distinguish present\054 excused and unexcused \055 \0431\054 \0433\056\012These IDs are local proposals because the supplied brief has no requirement numbers\056 Official class\012SRS mapping remains pending \055 \0434\056\012\012QUICK START\0121\056 Clone the team repository https\072\057\057github\056com\057Arda190777\057C3L and check out\012feature\057attendance\055sprint\0551 \055 or the candidate tag\056\0122\056 From the repo root run\072 bun install \055\055frozen\055lockfile\0123\056 Run\072 bun run dev\0124\056 Open http\072\057\057localhost\0723000\05710\055attendance or select Module 10 on the common home page\056\0125\056 Enter sample course PROG3000\054 student S1001 and date 2026\05510\05516\056 Choose Present\054 optionally\012add a note\054 then Save attendance\056\0126\056 The history page opens with a saved message and the matching record\056\0127\056 To correct it\054 open Record attendance and save the SAME IDs\057date with Absent \055 excused or Absent\012\055 unexcused\056 The existing row is updated rather than duplicated\056\0128\056 On Attendance history\054 enter optional course\057student IDs and from\057to dates\056 Apply filters\056 IDs match\012exactly and dates include both endpoints\056 Clear filters to view all local marks\056\0129\056 Restart the server to confirm stored marks remain\056 Data is local to\012src\057modules\05710\055attendance\057data\057attendance\056sqlite \055 git\055ignored\056\012\012JSON API\012POST \05710\055attendance\057api\057attendance accepts JSON strings courseId\054 studentId\054 date\054 status and\012optional notes\056 Success\072 200 with record\056 GET the same path with optional courseId\057studentId\057from\057to\012query parameters\073 success\072 200 with records array\056\012Status values\072 present\054 excused\054 unexcused\056\012Invalid fields\057dates\072 422\056 Storage failure\072 503\056 The HTML save returns 303 to history\056\012\012VALIDATION \057 LIMITS\012IDs are trimmed\054 1\05550 characters\056 Date is a real YYYY\055MM\055DD date\056 Notes are optional and up to 300\012characters\056 One mark per student\057course\057day\056 Use sample data only until \0435 is complete\056\012\012BUILD \057 DESIGN\012Module code and tests are JavaScript\056 The shared host remains TypeScript and supports index\056js\056\012Elysia and Bun native SQLite are used without adding packages or editing common code\056 Run\012doxygen src\057modules\05710\055attendance\057Doxyfile to rebuild the HTML design documentation\056\012\012NEXT STEPS\012Finish actual teammate review\054 shared SRS update and demo before final submission\056 Participation\054\012reports and statistics stay in \0436\056)
>>
endobj
